{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The only place where prehistory and the future coexist!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>Everything takes place on Earth, long before humans existed. The first living beings, also known as &quot;Existentials&quot;, were extremely powerful and created lesser Existentials to serve as their slaves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bereshipsis is a turn-based RPG where you control an entire team that opposes their masters\u2019 ideas, which would only lead to an apocalyptic end for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/Sumerian_cosmology_infographic.gif?t=1749739328\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Push, turn invisible, upgrade your skills, teleport across the board, and even control your own enemies if you wish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/hidden_Sumerian_truth.gif?t=1749739328\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/mage-fireball-skill-tree.gif?t=1749739328\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I LOVE CHOCOLATE MILK!!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The choices you make in the story matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mostly created by a single person.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each playable character (Existential) has unique mechanics, with their own upgradable moves and different playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seriously, I love chocolate milk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Existential has one or two &quot;Formalities&quot;, like rock-paper-scissors. Each has an advantage over another, granting exclusive benefits based on your Formality. Colossus, Predator, Invader, Occultist, Analyst, Acrobat, and Changeling. Choose your favorite!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Love and handcrafted chaos in every pixel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vision is fundamental: all Existentials provide a radius of how far they can see rival Existentials. Fortunately, the enemy has exactly the same limits as you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have I mentioned I love chocolate milk?</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3798630?t=1749739328","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3798630?t=1749739328","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/39ad75d2d98ea380983ff71269bb247d9b9702ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749739328","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/39ad75d2d98ea380983ff71269bb247d9b9702ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749739328","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The only place where prehistory and the future coexist!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>Everything takes place on Earth, long before humans existed. The first living beings, also known as &quot;Existentials&quot;, were extremely powerful and created lesser Existentials to serve as their slaves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bereshipsis is a turn-based RPG where you control an entire team that opposes their masters\u2019 ideas, which would only lead to an apocalyptic end for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/Sumerian_cosmology_infographic.gif?t=1749739328\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Push, turn invisible, upgrade your skills, teleport across the board, and even control your own enemies if you wish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/hidden_Sumerian_truth.gif?t=1749739328\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/mage-fireball-skill-tree.gif?t=1749739328\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I LOVE CHOCOLATE MILK!!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The choices you make in the story matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mostly created by a single person.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each playable character (Existential) has unique mechanics, with their own upgradable moves and different playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seriously, I love chocolate milk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each Existential has one or two &quot;Formalities&quot;, like rock-paper-scissors. Each has an advantage over another, granting exclusive benefits based on your Formality. Colossus, Predator, Invader, Occultist, Analyst, Acrobat, and Changeling. Choose your favorite!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Love and handcrafted chaos in every pixel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vision is fundamental: all Existentials provide a radius of how far they can see rival Existentials. Fortunately, the enemy has exactly the same limits as you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have I mentioned I love chocolate milk?</p></li></ul>","developers":["Vic"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/e2a4710a47d6a93c5c3695bb670b112422fcf19e/header.jpg?t=1749739328","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257153177,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153177/movie480.mp4?t=1749662228","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153177/movie_max.mp4?t=1749662228"},"name":"Bereshipsis Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257153177/ec375cf651756921df49afaacc3a51809376535f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749662228","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153177/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749662228","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153177/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749662228"}}],"name":"Bereshipsis","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Celeron N4020<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Vulkan supported GPU<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 180 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Vic"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Atos criminosos\nViol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Verbrechen","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/62f64f5b621839c843c963222d53e3ffce6359fc/ss_62f64f5b621839c843c963222d53e3ffce6359fc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1749739328","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse